/*
 * Seconds between vehicles, per line and per (line, stop).
 *
 * GENERATED — do not edit by hand; re-run `pnpm --filter api generate:headways`.
 * TJ values combine the frequencies of every weekday route variant serving a
 * stop (1/Σ(1/h)); rail values are the median gap between departures in the
 * schedules table. Both are clamped to [120, 3600] seconds.
 * See generateHeadways.ts for why.
 *
 * Consumed by routes/fares.ts as the planner's expected-wait input and by the
 * /stations/:operator/:code/headway endpoint. It is an average, not a schedule:
 * it cannot say when the next vehicle comes, only how long a rider tends to
 * wait for one.
 */

